# Get refused completing a blocked item, reopen a finished one and undo that from the
# list, then archive one from the reader and undo that.
mask /Created: [A-Z][a-z]+ \d+, \d{4}/ "Created: <date>"
mask /on item [0-9a-f]{8}/ "on item <id>"

wait Export posts from the old CMS
press tab
wait [Enter]read
press J J
wait > ○ Set up redirects for the old URLs
press J
wait > ○ Point DNS at the new host

press space
wait Cannot complete: item has unresolved blockers
frame refused-while-blocked

press K K
wait > ✓ Pick a theme
press space
wait Marked incomplete
wait > ○ Pick a theme
frame toggled
press u
wait Undo:
wait > ✓ Pick a theme
frame undone

press enter
wait Item 2 ·
press x
gone Pick a theme
frame archived-from-the-reader
press u
wait Undo:
wait Pick a theme
frame archive-undone

press q
exits
